# Local secrets. DEPLOY.md and README.md both tell you to `cp .env.example .env`,
# so every env file except the checked-in examples must be ignored by name —
# previously only `.env.local` was, which left a live `.env` (DATABASE_URL,
# NIM_API_KEY, MODAL_TOKEN_SECRET) one `git add -A` away from being pushed.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
